hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"445","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"446","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"447","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from 'Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman from A'isha"
"448","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al Mundhir that Asma bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq said"
"451","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sharik ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Namir that Anas ibn Malik said"
"452","Yahya related to me from Malik from Salih ibn Kaysan from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud that Zayd ibn Khalid al- Juhani said"
"453","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"454","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abu Hurayra used to say"